    "你盯着安布，他只是站在那里，整个人吓得僵住了，目光在你和桥根怪之间来回游移。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_276b2bc8:

    # "He remains frozen for a few more seconds, and you seem to be running out of air, your vision blurs as it is replaced by patches of greenery."
    "他又僵了几秒，而你似乎快要喘不上气了，视野逐渐模糊，取而代之的是一片片绿色。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_d5f3c927:

    # a "Haargh!"
    a "哈啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_9b56a923:

    # "Amble swings his hammer towards its head, and its shrieks just get louder all at once, which has shaken your very soul."
    "安布挥锤砸向它的脑袋，它的尖啸声骤然变得更加响亮，连你的灵魂都仿佛被震动了。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_785c4d2e:

    # "The bridgeroot rises up, and then suddenly, it falls to the side with a resounding thump."
    "桥根怪站起身来，紧接着突然向一侧倒下，轰然砸地。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_71b459d6:

    # "It's a long time since you take a breath, so you just lie there, trying to take in your breath as Amble extends his hand for you to stand up."
    "你已经很久没能呼吸了，只能躺在那里拼命喘气，而安布伸手拉你起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_a7b4cf16:

    # "You stare at the scene, the moss monster quickly fades into stillness as its green colour turns into a dull brown, before sinking itself into the earth."
    "你盯着眼前的景象，苔藓怪很快便陷入死寂，绿色褪成暗淡的棕色，随后沉入大地。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_71bb5413:

    # e "I-I am so sorry, I know I promised we wouldn't kill him."
    e "对、对不起，我知道我答应过不会杀了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_c63515ac:

    # "He nods, almost hesitantly."
    "他点了点头，动作几乎带着些迟疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_4693e987:

    # a "You were in danger right there, I had to."
    a "你刚才有危险，我不得不这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_824577c7:

    # "Amble kneels down, swirling his finger against the dirts where the monster once resided."
    "安布跪了下来，用手指在怪物曾经栖身的泥土上打着旋。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_dfe99824:

    # a "It was like what Lot described."
    a "就像洛特描述的那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_ce753a35:

    # "You notice he slowly closes aimless eyes shut, his ears only droop lower."
    "你注意到他慢慢闭上了那双无神的眼睛，耳朵也垂得更低了。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_a994b4a9:

    # e "The monster?"
    e "那个怪物？"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_4faacc80:

    # a "Oh, yes. The monster, was it the golem... he mentioned to me that the one from the goats was making some troubles around the river."
    a "哦，对。那个怪物……是魔像吗？他提到过，山羊那边的那个在河边惹了些麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_cb7f1ca7:

    # a "Maybe, he made a good friend in the river here?"
    a "也许，他在这里的河里交到了一个好朋友？"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_e416dd78:

    # e "Well, at least this one didn't want to outright murder us, immediately."
    e "好吧，至少这个没有一上来就想把我们直接杀掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_060fd6d8:

    # "He gives you a few glances."
    "他瞥了你几眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_6d2f005d:

    # a "Let's continue our work, good friend."
    a "我们继续干活吧，好朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_win_04ab9d9d:

    # "Amble grins, but you can tell there's still tint of sadness in his glistening eyes, even as he doesn't like to show this side of him."
    "安布咧嘴一笑，但你看得出他闪亮的眼眸里仍带着一丝悲伤，尽管他并不喜欢展露这一面。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_c75ee311:

    # "You notice the bridgeroot staring at you for a moment, before sitting back on the pedestal again."
    "你注意到桥根怪盯着你看了一会儿，随后又坐回了基座上。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_3b690530:

    # "Both you and Amble shakes your head as you sigh in exhaustion."
    "你和安布都疲惫地叹了口气，摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_2fa95d2c:

    # a "Ahhh! What a bummer, it doesn't look like we're scaring him away."
    a "啊——真扫兴，看样子我们吓不走他。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_7053e14e:

    # e "W-what should we do?"
    e "我、我们该怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_f78da463:

    # a "I think we should just take some rest, and then come back and hope he's gone."
    a "我觉得我们还是先休息一会儿，然后再回来，希望那时他已经走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_56a1c9cc:

    # e "Shouldn't we try again?"
    e "我们不该再试一次吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_fb0eda12:

    # a "I... I don't want to kill him, if he's being this stubborn, we'll soon left with no choice if we keep on fighting."
    a "我……我不想杀了他。要是他这么顽固，我们继续打下去，很快就只能杀了他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_385a3a41:

    # "Amble points at the bridgeroot, who's sitting on the bridge, watching water flow by."
    "安布指向坐在桥上、注视着流水的桥根。"

translate schinese_rewrite bridgeroot_lose_c4531b39:

    # e "I suppopse you're right, Amble."
    e "我想你说得对，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_8c2cd449:

    # "Vurro raises his nails, his scrawny furs doesn't hide his tired face, but he still holds out a wide smile."
    "伏罗抬起爪子，稀疏的毛发掩不住他疲惫的面容，但他依然咧嘴露出灿烂的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_00efba93:

    # "Vurro gets near you and slashing you with his sharp claws multiple times."
    "伏罗靠近你，用锋利的爪子连续劈砍。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_3e1404ad:

    # "At least he made sure to be gentle with you. Your health decreases by [total_enemy_damage] HP."
    "至少他还特意对你手下留情了。你的生命值减少了[total_enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_f86112ce:

    # "The brown werewolf bursts out from nowhere, trying to slash you with his sharp claws multiple times, but you manage to dodge the attack."
    "那头棕色狼人突然从不知哪里冲出，试图用锋利的爪子连续劈砍你，但你成功躲开了攻击。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_a86f060c:

    # "Vurro punches you directly with his fist. Knocking you out momentarily. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "伏罗一拳正中你，将你暂时击昏。你的生命值减少了[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_cb8272e5:

    # "Vurro tries to punch you, but he misses just above your fur, he stands back in frustration."
    "伏罗试图挥拳，却擦着你的毛发上方打空了。他恼怒地退了回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_bf81a2cb:

    # v "Look at that movement, you're doing pretty good."
    v "看看这身法，你做得相当不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_c1d9e09e:

    # v "Be careful, you might bleed for a while."
    v "小心，你可能会流血一阵子。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_52430236:

    # "Vurro slashes his hand across you, his claws easily scraping against your side. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "伏罗挥手向你横扫而过，利爪轻易地擦过你的侧腹。你的生命值减少了[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_c808726b:

    # "You begin to bleed from your wound."
    "你的伤口开始流血。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_10056391:

    # v "Huh, my claws are really getting sharper."
    v "咦，我的爪子好像真的变得更锋利了。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_d48a1192:

    # "Your bleeding has gotten worse from Vurro."
    "伏罗让你的出血加重了。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_a518ffcc:

    # v "It's so weird... your blood scent is making me all dizzy."
    v "真奇怪……你血液的气味让我头晕目眩。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_95989dfa:

    # "Vurro heaps a potion from his back pocket."
    "伏罗从后袋里掏出一瓶药水。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_556d8e92:

    # v "Technically, Uffe doesn't like potions, but he might heal himself in some ways."
    v "严格来说，乌菲不喜欢药水，但他或许能用某些方法治愈自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_b43cd03c:

    # "The brown werewolf raises his fist and swing swiftly towards your head."
    "那头棕色狼人抬起拳头，迅速朝你的脑袋挥去。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_2b15e1dd:

    # "It hits you pretty hard as you hold onto your nose, you are stunned for one round."
    "这一拳打得你相当重，你捂住鼻子，被眩晕了一回合。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_6bfe3d1b:

    # "You quickly tilt your head to the side, narrowly dodging his attack."
    "你迅速将头偏向一侧，险之又险地躲开了他的攻击。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_battle_loop_83bd4c2e:

    # v "Oh, you're quicker than I thought!"
    v "哦，你比我想的要快！"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_ca8eac9d:

    # v "U...ughhh..."
    v "呜……呃啊……"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_4b71ba1d:

    # e "V-vurro?"
    e "伏、伏罗？"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_1f454d5d:

    # "The brown werewolf in front of you looks extremely exhausted, struggling to open his eyes in front of you."
    "你面前的棕色狼人看起来精疲力竭，拼命想睁开眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_3201a0e5:

    # "Suddenly, he falls forwards to the ground with a big thump, raising a gust of dirts and grasses."
    "突然，他重重地向前扑倒在地，扬起一阵尘土和草屑。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_c72b9246:

    # e "H-hey! Vurro!"
    e "喂、喂！伏罗！"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_871ec0a7:

    # e "F-fuck, no. Wake up. Vurro!"
    e "该、该死，不要这样。醒醒，伏罗！"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_b785c4fd:

    # "You rush towards the werewolf in full speed, leaning onto his chest to check for his pulse."
    "你全速冲向那头狼人，俯身贴上他的胸口，检查他的脉搏。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_13840b92:

    # "For a few seconds, a loud doubt reverberates in your mind, telling you that you've just killed... your own friend."
    "短短几秒间，一个强烈的疑虑在你脑海中回荡，告诉你……你刚刚杀死了自己的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_c5871551:

    # v "[e]...?"
    v "[e]……？"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_145e9e83:

    # "He opens his eyes again, blinking. Staring at your worried face."
    "他再次睁开眼睛，眨了眨眼，凝视着你满是担忧的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_5cacdbed:

    # v "I-... I heard you screaming."
    v "我、……我听到了你的尖叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_552fcdac:

    # "You hold your hand over your mouth in shock, all of these transpired in mere seconds, and you have no idea how to react to that."
    "你震惊地抬手捂住嘴。这一切只在短短几秒内发生，你完全不知道该如何反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_c5df69f1:

    # v "S-shit... That was close. I almost fell asleep."
    v "该、该死……真险。我差点就睡着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_5eb81cc0:

    # "His eyes widen, nails almost bury themselves into his own skin, leaving behind lines of red marks underneath his fur."
    "他的双眼睁大，指甲几乎刺进自己的皮肤，在毛发下留下道道红痕。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_894fa8db:

    # e "W-what happened? Vurro?"
    e "怎、怎么回事？伏罗？"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_3d1a590c:

    # "Vurro's breathing rhythm quickens, his pupil expands just after having experienced being near death."
    "伏罗的呼吸节奏加快了，刚经历过濒死一刻的他，瞳孔也随之放大。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_0948ecbb:

    # "A few seconds have passed as you sit alongside Vurro, accompanied by a series of gasps and abrupt breathing."
    "几秒过去了，你坐在伏罗身旁，陪着他的阵阵喘息和急促呼吸。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_win_0cf1201e:

    # v "I- I think I almost died."
    v "我、我好像差点死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_4aa6e030:

    # e "I... I lost... Vurro?"
    e "我……我输了……伏罗？"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_7d3e6052:

    # "Without enough stamina to keep fighting, you shout to the brown werewolf, who seems a little different than usual."
    "你已经没有足够的体力继续战斗，只能朝那头棕色狼人喊去，而他看起来似乎和平时有些不同。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_7655ee5e:

    # "He only grunts, loudly."
    "他只是发出一声响亮的低吼。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_5caa3a0a:

    # e "Vurro?"
    e "伏罗？"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_066934cf:

    # "You shout once more, but he doesn't seem to notice."
    "你又喊了一声，但他似乎没有注意到。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_3708f2f6:

    # "With a swing of his claws, a gust of wind come propelling you in the air, sending you across the forest."
    "他挥动利爪，一阵狂风将你卷上半空，把你吹过整片森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_75b3f9f3:

    # "You only stop when your back and head comes into contact with a tree, putting a brake on a fleeting flight."
    "直到你的后背和脑袋撞上一棵树，你才停下来，短暂的飞行也随之刹住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_4cecb134:

    # v "Oh shit... Are you alright? [e]?"
    v "糟了……你还好吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_9c69210d:

    # "You fall limp on the dirt, consciousness fades in and out momentarily as your eyes almost closed."
    "你瘫倒在泥地上，双眼几乎闭合，意识一时断断续续。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_1df95d5c:

    # v "I- I'm so sorry. That feral's strength, it's coming back in me and I had no idea."
    v "我、我真的很抱歉。那股野性的力量正在我体内复苏，我完全没意识到。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_9b0f18c8:

    # e "Ugh...u-ugh..."
    e "呃……呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_715915e8:

    # "For a moment your vision blurred into blobs of green, but Vurro manages to get a hold of your injury."
    "片刻间，你的视线模糊成一片片绿色，而伏罗设法按住了你的伤处。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_4efc55ef:

    # e "I- unngh... F-fuck. My head is hurting."
    e "我、呃嗯……操。我的头好痛。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_359f892a:

    # "You clutch the back of head, almost the same place you were knocked out of."
    "你捂住后脑勺，几乎就是之前被打晕的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_5ccabbcb:

    # v "Shit. Any bleeding still needed to be taken care of?"
    v "该处理的出血还有吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite vurro_spar_lose_4abadad3:

    # e "I-I don't think so. I definitely underestimated your power, didn't expect a gust of wind to blow me away like that."
    e "我、我想应该没有。我确实严重低估了你的力量，没想到一阵风就能把我吹飞成那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_battle_7a79ee62:

    # "The small spriteling thrashes its ephereal claws about, but you doubt it deals any damage."
    "小幽魂挥舞着虚幻的爪子，但你觉得它应该造成不了什么伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_battle_loop_634cb2bf:

    # "The spriteling wraps his spectral form around you, trying to bind you. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "小幽魂用幽灵般的身躯缠住你，试图将你束缚。你的生命值减少了[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_battle_loop_fc52b4aa:

    # "The spriteling swings his spectral form around you, but you manage to dodge the attack."
    "小幽魂挥动着幽灵般的身躯朝你袭来，但你设法躲过了攻击。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_battle_loop_2e05915c:

    # "The ghostly creature raises its arm, and a gust of wind blows towards you."
    "小幽魂抬起手臂，一阵风朝你吹来。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_battle_loop_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_battle_loop_de0d3f8f:

    # "It doesn't seem to have any effect on you."
    "这阵风似乎对你毫无影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_win_fe785269:

    # "The whispy spriteling disperses into the air, leaving nothing but a faint scent of grass around."
    "朦胧的小幽魂消散在空气中，周围只留下一丝淡淡的青草气息。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_win_701c1fba:

    # "You feel a little bit of energy returning to you, as if the spriteling itself has given you a little bit of its own energy."
    "你感觉有一丝能量回到了体内，仿佛小幽魂本身将少许自身能量给了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_win_712959e4:

    # "The whispy spriteling disperses into the air, leaving nothing but a faint scent of moss around."
    "朦胧的小幽魂消散在空气中，周围只留下一丝淡淡的苔藓气息。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_win_a92bd5c1:

    # "You feel a little bit of energy returning to you, as the speckles of the spriteling begin drifting around you."
    "你感觉有些能量正在回归，小幽魂的点点微光开始在你周围飘荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_891befeb:

    # "Unable to continue, you faint on the ground, and the spriteling disappears into the air."
    "你再也支撑不住，昏倒在地，小幽魂也消散在空气中。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_891befeb_1:

    # "Unable to continue, you faint on the ground, and the spriteling disappears into the air."
    "你再也支撑不住，昏倒在地，小幽魂也消散在空气中。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_de006fce:

    # e "Ugh..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_59f9f38e:

    # "The darkness envelops you, but not before you see a glimpse of Furkan and Rahim running towards you."
    "黑暗将你笼罩，但在那之前，你瞥见弗坎和雷希姆正朝你跑来。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_14492b25:

    # "The next thing you know, you are already outside of the temple."
    "等你回过神来，已经到了神殿外。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_b977dc72:

    # "Exhausted all your energy, you struggle to get up, or to even open your eyes."
    "耗尽了所有气力后，你挣扎着想要起身，甚至连睁开眼睛都无比艰难。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_a702d58f:

    # yu "Allfather. Someone please... come save me."
    yu "天父啊。求求谁来……救救我。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_3d6c95a4:

    # "Obviously, passing out on a wild forest isn't a great idea, but there are no other choice given here..."
    "在荒野森林里昏过去显然不是什么好主意，不过眼下也别无选择……"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_165c9c17:

    # "Soon, your world fades into darkness."
    "很快，你眼前的世界便陷入黑暗。"

translate schinese_rewrite spriteling_lose_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite spritebinder_battle_33682342:

    # "The hooded sprite flaunts its arms, seemingly preparing to cast a spell."
